Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 02:57:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): separate WCS feature picks by role

Stop circle and anchor pick modes when a WCS role starts picking.
Show four feature rows with separate pick and clear controls.
Keep the existing alignment check and undoable WCS command.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2625
